//   Permission = perm.pkg.install
//
// # Why it's split from permission.admin into two interfaces
//
// The two point in opposite directions and have different implementers:
//
//   nervus.interface.permission.admin  implemented inside nervud, called by permissionui
//                                       (changes runtime grant state)
//   nervus.interface.permission.ui     implemented by permissionui, called by Settings/the desktop
